<section class="faq-cta section section--dark" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-cta__grid">

      <!-- FAQ column -->
      <div class="faq__col">
        <p class="t-eyebrow faq__label" data-anim>Have questions?</p>
        <h2 class="t-h2 faq__title" data-anim data-anim-delay="1">We've got answers.</h2>

        <div class="accordion" role="list" data-anim data-anim-delay="2">

          <div class="accordion__item" role="listitem">
            <button class="accordion__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="accordion__q">Will my cat actually use it?</span>
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__answer">
              <p class="accordion__a">Most cats claim it within the first 24 hours. Place it at desk height where they already like to sit, add a pinch of catnip, and let them investigate at their own pace. The deep bowl shape naturally appeals to cats that seek enclosed, nest-like spaces — that's most of them. And if yours is the exception, our 30-day guarantee means you're not out a penny.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="accordion__item" role="listitem">
            <button class="accordion__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="accordion__q">What desks does it fit?</span>
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__answer">
              <p class="accordion__a">Works on solid wood, wooden panel, marble, and metal desks with a straight edge up to ~2 inches (5 cm) thick. Not ideal for thin glass or desks with unusual lips or curves. Not sure? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@deskpaws.com" style="color:var(--terracotta);">hello@deskpaws.com</a> and we'll tell you straight.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="accordion__item" role="listitem">
            <button class="accordion__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="accordion__q">Will it scratch or damage my desk?</span>
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__answer">
              <p class="accordion__a">No. The G-clamp includes soft rubber padding on every contact point — top, bottom, and sides. No marks, no scratches, no damage to your surface finish. We've tested it on wood, marble, and metal.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="accordion__item" role="listitem">
            <button class="accordion__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="accordion__q">Is it stable? My cat is a jumper.</span>
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__answer">
              <p class="accordion__a">The metal G-clamp locks tight — once you've hand-tightened it, it doesn't move. The frame supports up to 50 lbs (more than any domestic cat), and the woven base distributes weight evenly. We've had zero reports of wobble from an impact landing.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="accordion__item" role="listitem">
            <button class="accordion__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="accordion__q">How do I clean it?</span>
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__answer">
              <p class="accordion__a">Remove the sherpa cushion cover, hand-wash with mild detergent in cold water, and air dry — don't put it in the dryer. The metal frame just needs a quick wipe down. Easy.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="accordion__item" role="listitem">
            <button class="accordion__trigger" aria-expanded="false">
              <span class="accordion__q">How long does shipping take?</span>
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="11"/><line x1="1" y1="6" x2="11" y2="6"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="accordion__answer">
              <p class="accordion__a">We ship within 1–2 business days. Delivery to US addresses takes approximately 10 days. You'll receive a tracking number the moment it ships.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA panel -->
      <div class="cta-panel" data-anim data-anim-delay="2">
        <p class="t-eyebrow cta-panel__eyebrow">Zero risk. Total peace.</p>

        <h3 class="cta-panel__title">
          Give your cat their spot.<br>Get your desk back.
        </h3>

        <p class="cta-panel__sub">
          Closeness without chaos. A happy cat one hand-reach away — and a keyboard that's finally yours.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-panel__price-row">
          <p class="cta-panel__anchor">Premium desk beds run $150–$179.</p>
          <p class="cta-panel__price">$79</p>
          <p class="cta-panel__price-note">Free shipping · Ships in 1–2 days</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-panel__guarantee">
          <span class="cta-panel__guarantee-icon">🛡️</span>
          <p class="cta-panel__guarantee-text">
            <strong>30-day happy-cat guarantee.</strong> If your cat snubs it and you're not happy, we'll refund you in full — and you keep the bed. No questions, no hassle.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/deskpaws" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg btn--full">
          Claim My Cat's Spot — $79
        </a>

        <p class="cta-panel__trust">
          🔒 Secure checkout &nbsp;·&nbsp; Visa / Mastercard / PayPal &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a href="mailto:hello@deskpaws.com" style="color:rgba(250,246,239,0.5);">hello@deskpaws.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

